### BEFORE (Original Test - REJECTED)
```
Caddyfile.template: reverse_proxy bridge:8443  ❌ WRONG SERVICE
docker-compose.yml:   armorclaw-sentinel:8080  ✅ CORRECT

Result: Caddy tries to connect to non-existent service "bridge" on port 8443
```

### AFTER (Fix Applied - APPROVED)
```
Caddyfile.template: reverse_proxy armorclaw-sentinel:8080  ✅ CORRECT
docker-compose.yml:   armorclaw-sentinel:8080              ✅ CORRECT

Result: Caddy connects to existing service "armorclaw-sentinel" on port 8080
```

